# Changed paths that cannot affect the game. A PR whose changed files all match a line here gets the
# light CI gate (commit check, plus a syntax check of any .js or .mjs it touches); anything else gets
# the full run. Patterns are shell globs where * also matches /. A line starting with ! excludes
# paths even when another line matches them (extglob patterns work, such as !(a|b)). CI reads this
# file from main, never from the PR,
# and a PR that changes it (or scripts/ci-classify.sh) always gets the full run.
docs/*
*.md
.github/pull_request_template.md
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
blender/logo/*
!src/*
!public/*
!.github/!(pull_request_template.md|ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*)
!*package*.json
